{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [{}],
  "wsWinStyles": [{}],
  "wpWinPositions": [{}],
  "events": [
    {
      "tStartMs": 1360,
      "dDurationMs": 1840,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "I'm willing to bet that literally"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 3200,
      "dDurationMs": 4240,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "no one ever climbed out of a Rimac Nevera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 7440,
      "dDurationMs": 2440,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "and thought, \"Oh dear, that needs more power.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 9880,
      "dDurationMs": 3360,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "And, \"I wish it was faster\nround my local racetrack.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 13440,
      "dDurationMs": 4200,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "But Mate Rimac can't sit still,\nand some of the hypercar market"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 17640,
      "dDurationMs": 1680,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "is not convinced by EVs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 19320,
      "dDurationMs": 4600,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "So this is how Rimac answers back\nwith the Nevera R."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 28840,
      "dDurationMs": 2840,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "Now I'll talk you around all\nthe visual tweaks in a moment,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 31680,
      "dDurationMs": 2560,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "but let's just get straight to the power."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 34480,
      "dDurationMs": 6560,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "OK. Rimac's Nevera – 1,888bhp."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 41040,
      "dDurationMs": 5040,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "Nevera R – 2,078bhp."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 46840,
      "dDurationMs": 2560,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "Now, let's just lay some context\non those numbers."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 49640,
      "dDurationMs": 6200,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "The fastest Ferrari ever around the\nFiorano test track is the SF90 XX –"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 56280,
      "dDurationMs": 4120,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "and this has more power than two of them."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 60400,
      "dDurationMs": 4000,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "And that makes for acceleration numbers\nthat just defy belief."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 64440,
      "dDurationMs": 2280,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "All your reference points are just blown away."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 67040,
      "dDurationMs": 2880,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "0-62 is the same as the standard car"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 69960,
      "dDurationMs": 3080,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "because it's limited by\nwhat tyres can put on the road."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 73200,
      "dDurationMs": 3000,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "But it's still 1.81 seconds."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 76480,
      "dDurationMs": 5600,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "But this thing gets from 0-186mph, or 300kph,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 82200,
      "dDurationMs": 3960,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "0.6 seconds quicker than that one."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 86160,
      "dDurationMs": 5080,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "It's also 3.5 seconds faster than \na Bugatti Chiron Super Sport,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 91240,
      "dDurationMs": 3960,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "1.5 seconds quicker than a Koenigsegg Jesko."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 95280,
      "dDurationMs": 3200,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "We're used to EVs that blow your mind\nleaving the line,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 98480,
      "dDurationMs": 2440,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "but normally they tail off into three figures."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 101640,
      "dDurationMs": 1320,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "Not this one."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 104760,
      "dDurationMs": 1680,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "So, how have they done it?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 106440,
      "dDurationMs": 1920,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "Well, because it's an EV,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 108360,
      "dDurationMs": 2760,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "I can't just open the bonnet and show you."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 111320,
      "dDurationMs": 5080,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "But it has got four new motors,\nwhich are not just more powerful than that car's,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 116400,
      "dDurationMs": 2960,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "they've also got the latest, greatest, cleverer version"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 119360,
      "dDurationMs": 3240,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "of that Rimac torque vectoring technology"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 122600,
      "dDurationMs": 3960,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "to share and shuffle the torque \nbetween all four corners."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 128000,
      "dDurationMs": 3640,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "And the battery powering those motors\nhas also been upgraded."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 131640,
      "dDurationMs": 4480,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "Capacity is 108kWh,\nbut the chemistry's been changed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 136200,
      "dDurationMs": 4720,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "It's lighter, but it's more about giving you\nthat higher sustained performance."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 141000,
      "dDurationMs": 3640,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "So, you bring it to a racetrack,\nyou can go flat out for longer,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 145240,
      "dDurationMs": 3960,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "which explains why the bodywork has\nhad these upgrades as well."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 150080,
      "dDurationMs": 2800,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "So how do you tell someone's got a Nevera R?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 153200,
      "dDurationMs": 1160,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "Here's the details."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 154360,
      "dDurationMs": 4280,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "You'll see at the front that that kind\nof nose cone off the old car is gone."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 158640,
      "dDurationMs": 4440,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "You've now got this sort of angry\ngecko face. New front splitter,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 163080,
      "dDurationMs": 3080,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "entirely different air management\naround this section of the car,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 166160,
      "dDurationMs": 1520,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "brakes have been upgraded,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 167680,
      "dDurationMs": 4880,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "a new silicon layer on your ceramic discs\nto improve stopping performance,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 172920,
      "dDurationMs": 3640,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "great big carbon fibre exposed \nsection in the door here -"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 176560,
      "dDurationMs": 3680,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "looks great – and wider side skirt."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 180240,
      "dDurationMs": 2840,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "And then you come round to the headline act."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 183080,
      "dDurationMs": 4160,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "Yes, where your standard Nevera\ngot a modest rear wing,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 187240,
      "dDurationMs": 5640,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "this one has a monster. Fully exposed\ncarbon fibre, triple supports,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 192880,
      "dDurationMs": 2840,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "kind of looks like an Aventador SVJ."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 195720,
      "dDurationMs": 5680,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "And the numbers are geeky.\n15% more downforce overall,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 201400,
      "dDurationMs": 4480,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "10% better aero efficiency, 10% less understeer,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 206040,
      "dDurationMs": 7040,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "and 3.8 seconds saved on\na lap of the Nardò test track."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 213480,
      "dDurationMs": 2040,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "Now, that is terribly impressive,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 215520,
      "dDurationMs": 2960,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "except, well, Nardò is a private test track."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 218520,
      "dDurationMs": 1680,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "It's closed to the public."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 220200,
      "dDurationMs": 2280,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "We can't go and see a car go round there."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 222480,
      "dDurationMs": 2960,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "That kind of begs the question,\nI wonder how fast one of these would go"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 225480,
      "dDurationMs": 3400,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "round Silverstone or Laguna Seca"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 228880,
      "dDurationMs": 1640,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "or the Nürburgring."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 237040,
      "dDurationMs": 2920,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "Hopefully, one day we will find out,\nbecause after all,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 239960,
      "dDurationMs": 2480,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "the whole point of the Nevera R"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 242440,
      "dDurationMs": 2480,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "is kind of a response from Mate Rimac"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 244920,
      "dDurationMs": 1680,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "to his customers who were saying,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 246600,
      "dDurationMs": 6840,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "\"Yeah, we appreciate that the normal Nevera\nis a great sort of GT everyday hypercar,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 253440,
      "dDurationMs": 2000,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "but we'd actually kind of like something"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 255440,
      "dDurationMs": 3280,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "that was a bit more of a ripper around a racetrack.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 258960,
      "dDurationMs": 1880,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "I have to say though, it really doesn't feel"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 260840,
      "dDurationMs": 4560,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "kind of stripped out and spartan,\nracetrack-ready in here."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 265400,
      "dDurationMs": 1880,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "It's still very nicely appointed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 267280,
      "dDurationMs": 4120,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "There's a lot more kind of \nAlcantara trim instead of leather –"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 272080,
      "dDurationMs": 3280,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "and they've painted the exposed \ncarbon on the dashboard here"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 275360,
      "dDurationMs": 3480,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "to match the paintwork.\nBut otherwise, seats are comfortable,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 278840,
      "dDurationMs": 2600,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "there's lots of screens, lots of equipment."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 281440,
      "dDurationMs": 4400,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "And don't just think it's a kind \nof soulless lap time king either,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 285840,
      "dDurationMs": 3960,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "because you can still twizzle\nthis knob here, select Drift mode"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 289800,
      "dDurationMs": 6080,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "and tell all 2,078bhp\nto send you sideways."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 296200,
      "dDurationMs": 1160,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "Madness."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 302480,
      "dDurationMs": 3200,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "Only 40 Nevera Rs are going to be built,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 305680,
      "dDurationMs": 5400,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "each costing just shy of £2 million,\nand I have no doubts that it will happily"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 311080,
      "dDurationMs": 4360,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "smash lap records and rupture internal organs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 316000,
      "dDurationMs": 920,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "It's just funny, though, isn't it?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 316920,
      "dDurationMs": 3440,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "Even Mate Rimac himself \nhas said that EV hypercars"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 320360,
      "dDurationMs": 3520,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "aren't selling like V12 or V16 ones are."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 323880,
      "dDurationMs": 880,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "Seems crazy, doesn't it?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 324760,
      "dDurationMs": 3880,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "A machine this wild, numbers this amazing –"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 329320,
      "dDurationMs": 3240,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "but will it be the future of the hypercar after all?"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
